{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0e97b7d48c5c7f2c9141b1d51b940fed1ba01282e44417ad3a318d61681a6364", "ja": "レコーディングが再開するが、スタッフとの\n意志疎通は不完全。歩と真は言葉ではなくダ\nンスで熱い思いを伝え、レコーディングは無\n事終了。そして帰国後、新曲公演で、ふたり\nは客席にも熱い思いを届けるのだった。", "zh": "录音重新开始，但与工作人员的\n沟通仍不顺畅。步和真没有用语言，\n而是用舞蹈传达了炽热的心意，录音顺\n利结束。回国后，在新曲公演中，两人\n也将这份炽热的心意传达给了观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9a34875350e443c4f1ed6ed12dbe9369ea90a3e94e78f8771ed3aaf02712b202", "ja": "（のり子や昴と一緒にスタジオに戻ってきたが、\n歩と真は外に出たまま、戻ってきていない……）", "zh": "（我和法子、昴一起回到了录音室，但步和真还在外面，一直没有回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "505b19b9af1a41ea753d97be3011fe682d345c9b5a949c17cd969da5b28ef491", "ja": "（このままでは、レコーディングが止まったままだ。\nふたりを探しにいくべきか……）", "zh": "（这样下去，录音还会一直停着。\n要不要去找找她们两个……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1002_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "d66be3f05ff639ab209dee3f85e17a7a0f1abbf407ac536c8b49e464ab980c18", "ja": "す、すみません！　遅くなりました！！", "zh": "对、对不起！我来晚了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9127eaa22cd260d011201a212a1b83acd713baa0fcdefbb9263b6915ca866cd9", "ja": "ハア、ハア……。\nごめん、{$P$}！", "zh": "哈、哈……。\n对不起，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "96bc1799377c511ef70d9963f1cc579a9b8aef446de6517b8a9cb5c51b64a397", "ja": "ふたりともお帰り。\n……その顔を見ると、ちゃんと話せたみたいだな。", "zh": "两位都回来了啊。\n……看你们的表情，应该已经好好谈过了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "95c19bc0f91b8923ad4d20b15b7ff759255681ace4c7b668ef64dd0a8dca3fba", "ja": "はいっ♪（うんっ♪）", "zh": "好呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "00ca2d5e0af51757823cf4dfed3851cb8d02e9d56a9966eef0f7f0894804278f", "ja": "うんっ♪", "zh": "嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "e1c02b1fafce4b0931a6d67bcacbbb715a3fe56b4ca7d3710bb66360050ea4b8", "ja": "もう、真も歩も。なかなか戻ってこないから、\nすごい心配したんだからね！", "zh": "真是的，真也是，步也是。迟迟不见你们回来，\n害我超担心的好不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2453bced5162dc43c4efc21fbcd363352454c09a51b427398fd29a35b7b1bf01", "ja": "あははっ。ごめん、ごめん。\nでも大丈夫だから。あ、多分ね。", "zh": "啊哈哈。抱歉抱歉。\n不过已经没事了啦。啊，大概吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "393b43eb9ed26e74cdfa0bc104583a7dfaa6f489d7339e98ca87960a4ba612c7", "ja": "ふたりとも、とってもいい顔してるネ！", "zh": "你们两个的表情都特别棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "5341abe589e1978ff1c4ecaa1f257fcaea9b8968b40ce53307f9f62c9bad7ee0", "ja": "うん。バシっと決めてこいよ！　真、歩！", "zh": "嗯。好好发挥，拿下它吧！真、步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "5c0ba97b1c8ea6fff73c80c19a4e8bb07705119f435163742582c2deb7e97572", "ja": "任せてよ！\n……歩、このまま行けるよね？", "zh": "交给我吧！\n……步，我们能就这样继续下去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6ad7a38e5591a1ed2752b2927be8dc70cab9bbf7a023c631d14643f6b5c1fc75", "ja": "もちろん！\n今の気持ちを、そのまま歌に乗せたい！", "zh": "当然！\n我想把现在的心情，就这样融入歌声中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "9a848cba0445fa533c432881563f856e02a454565a1e871a6a226485f273d7e5", "ja": "オッケー！　{$P$}、\nボク達、このままレコーディングしたいです！", "zh": "好！{$P$}，我们想就这样直接录音！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3af1dccb0e5ba81e3b933c06076c9718b43e895608136e1142e9f92d049515f7", "ja": "えっ、二人同時に？　……わかった。何度か歌って\nもらうことになるけど、まずは、やってみるか！", "zh": "诶，两个人要同时录？……知道了。虽然要让你们唱好几遍，但先试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a62ef86e0d2276d46d7530d4bc2b3ca6746816eebd749b88492e7abc2b49c776", "ja": "（ふたりの熱意もあり、レコーディングは再開した。\nまずは、一緒に録ることになったが……）", "zh": "（在两人的热情推动下，录音重新开始了。首先决定一起录制，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1017_director", "source_sha256": "917e52cd8b7ec0c59c1933d8f29cb15d860e5c93cd1faf4ff255af9ab0f6fe28", "ja": "ノー！　\nカルムダウン！　クール＆セクシー！", "zh": "不——！  \n冷静下来！又酷又性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "de2d238130e8c4bbd9b90004494e47b6464d08c0ea17adc7d090fed5f25282f3", "ja": "うわっ！　やっぱりダメ！？", "zh": "哇啊！果然还是不行吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "25f548fef54816bf0eb52d4950fb70d4397582bf6efdcadcb101fe5c8d05ce9a", "ja": "ボク達の間では話し合えたけど……。\nもう一度、ミーティングしてもらわないとダメかな？", "zh": "我们之间虽然谈妥了……  \n但还是得再开一次会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "67bc7b7358e40f4fd4d53e4359dcecc581bde1d128c3948d07037d64e55caa6a", "ja": "……うん。ミーティングも大事だけど、\nアタシ達は、アタシ達のやり方で伝えよう！", "zh": "……嗯。虽然开会也很重要，\n但我们要用我们自己的方式传达心意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1021_006mak", "source_sha256": "d90840e6fab5fab575f597a7fe79a3d6c006d5fc6808d5807844e2a17647962a", "ja": "ボク達のやり方……。そうか。\nうん、そうだね！", "zh": "我们的方式……这样啊。\n嗯，说得对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "aa3c16d0197ad9377c9b86bfc59f3d378a35337884de7ecab680ae2d1066f437", "ja": "今のアタシ達に必要なのは、言葉じゃない！\n……真、アタシが引っ張るから、ついてきて！", "zh": "现在的我们需要的不是言语！\n……真，我来带头，你跟上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f792e633df0fe65b54a6a44429f0d8b1c1aeb98467544771aba6c77e2d441329", "ja": "ヘイヘイヘーイ！\nカモーン、レッツダーンス！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿——！\n来吧，一起跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "733d915af7ab20661672638d83acf8345f65113e49a77363061b3a963941f1a6", "ja": "よーしっ、いっくぞー！", "zh": "好——要上了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "ff26c34797262151667846eb9a93ef56df70ec4b4b21745bd678ecd20d2b0294", "ja": "うわっ、どうしたんだ！？\nふたりがいきなり踊りだしたんだけど！", "zh": "哇，怎么回事！？\n两个人突然跳起舞来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "9576fdc34c9248966d44dbd16758cc7142e14629ea12049685a4c0cf6a8fd542", "ja": "なんだろ？　リズムとってるのかな？\nでも……あはは、とにかくなんか、すっごく楽しそう！", "zh": "这是怎么了？是在打节拍吗？\n不过……啊哈哈，总之看起来特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "8a47cc4bd328e4cafe06f4b6673ce978f8a339c79c0e750964732c4a0c26dfe1", "ja": "イェーイ♪　{$P$}、\nワタシも一緒に踊りたいヨー！　ダメ？", "zh": "耶♪　{$P$}，\n我也想一起跳舞哦——！不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a09c22f21aede2f265dc89bba4d343b6debf788896400636422448b603f108c5", "ja": "うーん、基本的にはダメだけど……でも……", "zh": "嗯——原则上是不行的……不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1029_director", "source_sha256": "104a480d1a9b2100a9853b8a76b928354452038dd5c5ea2d9fda50a2ab424070", "ja": "Oh！　ワンダフル！　ジャパニーズビート！！\nレコーディング・スタートナウ！！", "zh": "Oh！Wonderful！Japanese beat！！\nRecording・Start now！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "bec1f5f2926f8aef7ead74514d7f53799fdf8d87cdb2af3bde07cf9f5797f9c3", "ja": "気分が盛り上がってきたみたいだ！\nよし！", "zh": "感觉气氛越来越高涨了！\n好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e461ffcc698cdb1a857b158798f4953a1578b7f2fbb7350465365751f1813c4c", "ja": "イエスイエス！　サンキュー！\n真、うまくいったみたい！", "zh": "耶耶！谢谢！\n真，看来成功了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "78d1f51bb507c37559f8943693539deb9f49e6adb99c26bf85ff57e64e8bd4a4", "ja": "うんっ！　よーし、このまま今のボク達の全部を、\nこの曲とダンスに、ぶつけよう！", "zh": "嗯！好——那就把现在我们的全部力量，都倾注到这首歌和舞蹈中吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1033_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9cd5ebb1624aebbc899baa6bc36c52e06f5c0c66878b10804b89d7c73c7f6880", "ja": "オッケー！　イエーーーイ！", "zh": "好——！耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "73b1a6b3468587804c3e0f728f1379eae6cc4ebbafa5d4afb24643b2c759bee5", "ja": "（音楽、そしてダンスは国境を越える……。\nふたりの熱い思いは、無事に伝わったようだ！）", "zh": "（音乐和舞蹈能够跨越国界……两人的热情似乎顺利传达出去了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1035_p", "source_sha256": "9ac5a5d71d0fe6801f214105eb1ce23485d25eaefaeac794f057667ffa120e28", "ja": "（そして帰国後……。お披露目公演に向けて\n準備をしているうちに、公演当日がやってきた！）", "zh": "（然后回国后……在为展示演出做准备的过程中，演出当天终于到来了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1036_p", "source_sha256": "b90dd7e60bfd12fe6a061c2a58281dc89e4c370029d3aa5f8ff8a0aa7c55c6c9", "ja": "さて、次のMCが終わったら新曲のお披露目だ。\nふたりとも、準備はいいか？", "zh": "那么，下一段MC结束后就是新歌的首次演出了。  \n你们两个，都准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "62f55d9e6c6136529fd2547454d4e32c7c7361cc9fb9314e83e8391b4c6d5c82", "ja": "ボクは大丈夫です！　ちゃんと、タオルも持ってます！\n歩は、大丈夫？", "zh": "我没问题！毛巾也好好带着呢！\n步，你没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7505d025fb6eba98a8f3bb1e6843b8747f76047d383ebfa729909f6c80dd1200", "ja": "もちろん！　ほら、腰につけて……あれ？\nマイガー！！　アタシのタオルがないー！？", "zh": "当然没问题！你看，系在腰上……咦？\n天啊！！我的毛巾怎么不见了——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "0ed152348c2eb5b9bab6854e0e9b5445c1abd45f03b6130bc3bd51ca6e2efb2b", "ja": "お、落ち着いて！\n……あ、ドリンクの横にあるの、そうじゃない？", "zh": "喂、冷静一点！\n……啊，饮料旁边那个，不就是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f3f2560f83842cffa9ca935e25f25cf71faacb330bcc5d8e1e8cdce9f23143d4", "ja": "そうそう、これだよー！　サンキュー！", "zh": "对对，就是这个——！谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1041_p", "source_sha256": "9dbbcc32e47e32c4f4bb38981d3e1184d33f89ec097a7a0ff5de429f786af5ac", "ja": "……う、うん。準備は、大丈夫そうだな！", "zh": "……嗯、嗯。准备工作看起来没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0125_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0125_story_06_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "780c2c14a494ec5f8d26cf02c57b20b47b809bc0671ab8babd3ce57b92083381", "ja": "はい。今日は、世界中のお客さんを\n楽しませるつもりで、頑張りますね！", "zh": "是的。今天，我会努力让全世界的观众都开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
